SpaceX IPO investors — Land of freedom ?","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/us-broker-restrictions-on-spacex-ipo-investors/194964/5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":3,"comments":2,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-14T06:12:40.026Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-15T18:07:02.755Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-530820","source":"tradingqna","author":"nithin_kumrr","handle":"@nithin_kumrr","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-06-13T16:14:16.369Z","text":"US broker restrictions on SpaceX IPO investors — Now, the restrictions. Some U.S. brokers actively discourage investors from selling allotted IPO shares soon after listing. Check the restriction. Fidelity can restrict access to future IPO allocations for 6 months if allocated shares are sold within 15 calendar days. Second offense is a 1 year ban. Third offense is a permanent ban tied to your Social Security number. Robinhood can restrict access to future IPO allocations for 60 days if allocated shares are sold within 30 days. E*Trade says selling allocated IPO shares within 30 days can affect…","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/us-broker-restrictions-on-spacex-ipo-investors/194964/3","sentiment":"bearish","likes":2,"comments":1,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-14T06:12:40.026Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-15T18:07:02.755Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-530819","source":"tradingqna","author":"nithin_kumrr","handle":"@nithin_kumrr","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-06-13T16:13:07.600Z","text":"US broker restrictions on SpaceX IPO investors — So here’s the story. SpaceX came to market at a valuation of roughly $1.77 trillion. Within hours of trading, it crossed $2 trillion. The company sold 555.6 million shares at $135 each, raising $75 billion. Saudi Aramco’s $29.4 billion in 2019 was the previous record. This is nearly three times that. Total demand crossed $350 billion, making the offering roughly 4.5x oversubscribed. Retail side alone is $100 billion against maybe $15 to 17 billion available. The demand for the SpaceX IPO was far higher than the shares available. Many investors g…","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/us-broker-restrictions-on-spacex-ipo-investors/194964/2","sentiment":"bearish","likes":2,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-14T06:12:40.026Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-15T18:07:02.755Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-530818","source":"tradingqna","author":"nithin_kumrr","handle":"@nithin_kumrr","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-06-13T15:42:22.328Z","text":"US broker restrictions on SpaceX IPO investors — SpaceX crossed $2 trillion within hours of listing. The valuation is one thing, but some of the broker rules around IPO shares are downright bizarre. Quoting @nithin 's tweet from today. Sure, things can be better, but it’s crazy how transparent and safe the Indian markets are compared to the US, all thanks to SEBI and the exchanges. It’s not just Fidelity; even other big brokers seem to have ‘flipping’ restrictions in place HKq1Wy6awAEV8CM 1008×1241 163 KB","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/us-broker-restrictions-on-spacex-ipo-investors/194964/1","sentiment":"neutral","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-14T06:12:40.026Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-15T18:07:02.755Z"},{"id":"news-gn-9hWm9FWlJHQW5SazI0ajl3NmZoNmxUaw","source":"news","author":"CoinDesk","handle":"CoinDesk","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-13T05:18:43.000Z","text":"The SpaceX IPO scramble brings early lesson for tokenized stocks","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOMmRrVVpxUXdySFNzQ1RxNThqQm1VQVVCVWR2NnZMbUxJQWg2TVZvRzdmbjdIRDZHeWprdFNQcjBUa0g5cmQyRWZ2dEVHUk8zUk5ySW5OOVdxMUNrMlRKZllRdG80MDVUajE2aFRlNlRtSU5qMFNBNmkwS0VHS1UyejdMNElrMElMTWVnOFlMcFdoZXdVSmRNNElHRTR0RENEQ0x4Tmtsak9hWm9FWlJHQW5SazI0ajl3NmZoNmxUaw?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-06-13T05:53:23.189Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-06-13T15:16:20.537Z"},{"id":"news-gn-NRDBibmhTNWxHMnNxTmJlR1JYM2FvdFE","source":"news","author":"Goodreturns","handle":"Goodreturns","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-06-13T00:37:30.